description: Use main as the default branch for all git commits and pushes in this repo.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git branch policy

- Always work on the **`main`** branch for commits in this repository.
- Before committing, ensure the current branch is `main` (create it from `master` or check it out if needed).
- Do not commit on `master` or feature branches unless the user explicitly asks for a branch workflow.
- When pushing, push to `origin/main` unless the user specifies otherwise.
- Never force-push to `main` unless the user explicitly requests it.
